      "Local Shanghai EVM gas; not current mainnet measurement or monetary quote.",
      "Single-process trusted setup and deterministic public fixture salt/keys: never production.",
      "Stable commitment, holder address, deposit amount, credential ID and expiry remain public/linkable.",
      "Baseline already discloses only an issuer-signed eligibility bit. No automatic privacy superiority claim.",
      "Revocation is per gate and must be propagated; no oracle, issuer service, relayer or full KYC workflow.",
      "Receipt gas includes token transfer, calldata and verification; verifier gas must not be added again.",
      "No withdrawal function. Test tokens only."
